                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Zup! X: Click, Boom, Done\n\nRegret: 5% (it was cheap, and it was over quick)\n\nZup! X is a tiny physics puzzle game where you blow things up to get a block to the right place. That's it. It's cheap, quick and oddly satisfying. Perfect for when you have 10 minutes and want to feel smart. 3 hours in total, and I probably got a few achievements out of it too.\n",
